{"id":84976829061811,"name":"Bits Incremental!","desc":"Welcome to Bits Incremental! [V2.1.0]\n\nThis game is basically an incremental where you click to spawn various \"bits\"!\nWith these bits you can purchase upgrades and discover new currencies!\nYou can also compete for leaderboards!\nHowever, you'll need some luck to advance in game!\n\nJoin the group to start with extra bits!\n\nTo play in CO-OP multiplayer, you will need to use the new multiplayer menu in the main menu. Please note the 200p servers do not save data, as they are intended as one giant coop session.\n\nLocal splitscreen requires the use of controllers. Some devices may not support 8 players.\n\nThe game DOES save your data!\nNote that there may be some bugs, please tell me if so!\n\nInspired by \"Clicker Incremental\" by @DaMouseDev\n\nMade by @TheAntOfTheWorld for Ant Nest Studio\nHelped by scripter @louisd5","path":"/game/84976829061811-bits-incremental","slug":"84976829061811-bits-incremental","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d235e783ca80947257f22102a02b24e0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2bffcd245992991473ffa7001413c916/150/150/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":0,"visitor":294426,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-01-05T10:14:08.360Z","creator":{"name":"Ant Nest Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Bits-Incremental!-Leaderboard-script-ez-26034","_id":"677a5b70ea4516cd66452999","title":"Leaderboard  script  ez","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c783e9","gameId":84976829061811,"name":"Bits Incremental!","imageUrl":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-2bffcd245992991473ffa7001413c916/500/280/Image/Jpeg/noFilter","placeId":84976829061811},"features":"best orb in  game for leaderboard","tags":[],"script":"while true do\n    local args = {\n        [1] = \"Glitched\"\n    }\n\n    game:GetService(\"ReplicatedStorage\"):WaitForChild(\"Remotes\"